+## Package-ID migration gate (packaging-only proposal, 2026-10-11)
+
+The proposed `io.github.osher15.peultimate` identity is a **new app**, installed beside
+`app.netlify.peultimate`; it is not an in-place update and cannot read the old app's
+private storage automatically. Before switching: create an encrypted backup in the
+old app, retain the file and password, install the new-ID app, restore there, and
+verify classes, sid/cid, results, manual grades and language before removing the old
+install. Keep the old install and backup until the owner verifies recovery.
+The same-ID upgrade checks below do not prove this migration. Migration has not
+been physically tested; do not mark the device checklist passed.
